{"title":"2009 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The graph shows the constant rate at which Suzanna rides her bike. If she rides a total of a half an hour at the same speed, how many miles would she have ridden?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/6/8e6a016e771b1190c29cf5d287fb3a89514557bc.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] import graph; /* this is a label */ Label f;  f.p=fontsize(0); xaxis(-0.9,20,Ticks(f, 5.0, 5.0));  yaxis(-0.9,20, Ticks(f, 22.0,5.0)); // real f(real x)  {  return x; }  draw(graph(f,-1,22),black+linewidth(1)); label(&quot;1&quot;, (-1,5), black);  label(&quot;2&quot;, (-1, 10), black); label(&quot;3&quot;, (-1, 15), black); label(&quot;4&quot;, (-1, 20), black); dot((5,5), black+linewidth(5)); dot((10,10), black+linewidth(5)); dot((15, 15), black+linewidth(5)); dot((20,20), black+linewidth(5)); label(&quot;MINUTES&quot;, (11,-5), S); label(rotate(90)*&quot;MILES&quot;, (-5,11), W);[/asy]\" width=\"668\" height=\"668\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/9/1/49114ac6dc91f53ad88e5312f91600ef9507f743.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 5\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 5.5\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 6\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 6.5\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"379\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Suzanna's speed is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/2/d129a7b3c0bf9fbd0693afdd426a66d2a0a8c3ae.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"11\" height=\"37\" />. This means she runs <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/4/a/04a4743a76431b11ad2e7984a0711ea74189d5b6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{5} \\cdot 30 = \\boxed{ \\textbf{(C) }6 }$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"124\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>From the graph, we can see that every <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> minutes Suzanna goes, her distance increases by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. Since half an hour is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> minutes away, she would go <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> more miles. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/4/a/24a62631a12f3fa8bcef26abd1ecc86746318481.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4+2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"40\" height=\"13\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, so the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/5/435410e75dbe6713fb05d06615f0717f92605c58.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{ \\textbf{(C) }6 }$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"57\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~Trex226\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/USVVURBLaAc?t=117\">https://youtu.be/USVVURBLaAc?t=117</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_2\">Video Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/agfRvXTPxVc\">https://youtu.be/agfRvXTPxVc</a>\n</p><p>~savannahsolver\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_8\" title=\"2009 AMC 8\">2009 AMC 8</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_8_Problems\" title=\"2009 AMC 8 Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_8_Answer_Key\" title=\"2009 AMC 8 Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=2009\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2009 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a hr